: 137.0304,\n+            \"ruleKeys\": [\"cover.minimum\", \"lap.wall.minimum\"]\n+          },\n+          \"horizontal\": {\n+            \"lengthMm\": 6630,\n+            \"count\": 19,\n+            \"designKg\": 125.97,\n+            \"requiredKg\": 131.0088,\n+            \"ruleKeys\": [\"cover.minimum\", \"lap.wall.minimum\"]\n+          },\n+          \"totalDesignKg\": 257.73,\n+          \"totalRequiredKg\": 268.0392\n+        },\n+        \"handDerivation\": \"fc24・SD295・D13에서 표5.3.2 L1＝35d＝455mm, 耐力壁 하한 40d＝520mm이므로 継手長＝520mm. 定着 L1＝35d＝455mm, 縦筋 ＝ 3450＋2×455＋520＝4880mm, 本数＝⌈5200÷200⌉＋1＝27본, 質量＝4.880m×27×1.000＝131.760kg. 横筋은 내법 길이 5200＋2×455에 6000mm마다 1継手를 더해 6630mm, 本数＝⌈3450÷200⌉＋1＝19본, 質量＝6.630m×19×1.000＝125.970kg. 合計 設計数量＝257.730kg, 所要数量＝257.730×1.04＝268.0392kg\"\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"id\": \"wall-class-non-strength-wall\",\n+        \"wallClass\": \"耐力壁以外\",\n+        \"expected\": {\n+          \"lapMm\": 455,\n+          \"coverMm\": 20,\n+          \"vertical\": {\n+            \"lengthMm\": 4815,\n+            \"count\": 27,\n+            \"designKg\": 130.005,\n+            \"requiredKg\": 135.2052,\n+            \"ruleKeys\": [\"cover.minimum\", \"lap.L1\"]\n+          },\n+          \"horizontal\": {\n+            \"lengthMm\": 6565,\n+            \"count\": 19,\n+            \"designKg\": 124.735,\n+            \"requiredKg\": 129.7244,\n+            \"ruleKeys\": [\"cover.minimum\", \"lap.L1\"]\n+          },\n+          \"totalDesignKg\": 254.74,\n+          \"totalRequiredKg\": 264.9296\n+        },\n+        \"handDerivation\": \"같은 벽에서 wallClass만 耐力壁以外로 바꾼다. 40d 하한은 耐力壁限定이므로 継手長＝표5.3.2 L1＝35d＝455mm. 縦筋 ＝ 3450＋2×455＋455＝4815mm, 本数＝27본, 質量＝4.815m×27×1.000＝130.005kg. 横筋은 5200＋2×455＋455＝6565mm, 本数＝19본, 質量＝6.565m×19×1.000＝124.735kg. 合計 設計数量＝254.740kg, 所要数量＝254.740×1.04＝264.9296kg. ruleHits에는 cover.minimum과 lap.L1만 있고 lap.wall.minimum은 없다\"\n+      }\n+    ]\n+  },\n+\n   \"openingReinforcement\": {\n     \"clause\": \"1通則8) なお書き\"